fixed         | Independence Day                         | 5 26                 | public          |  |  |  |
decree        | Eid-Ul-Azha                              | 2024-6-17 2025-6-7   | public          |  |  |  |
decree        | CARICOM Day                              | 2024-7-1 2025-7-7    | public          |  |  |  |
fixed         | Emancipation Day                         | 8 1                  | public          |  |  |  |
decree        | Youman Nabi                              | 2024-9-16 2025-9-5   | public          |  |  |  |
decree        | Deepavali                                | 2024-10-31 2025-10-20 | public          |  |  |  |
fixed         | Christmas Day                            | 12 25                | public          |  |  |  |
fixed         | Day after Christmas                      | 12 26                | public          |  |  |  |
